    "Name": "Koschei",
    "Details": "Bearing the distinction of being the second Mech to be created by the Capellan Confederation, the Koschei began production in 2504 though production would cease during the Succession Wars; with production restarting during the Jihad. A 65-ton Mech, the Koschei 5I is powered by a 325-rated XL Engine giving it a top speed of 86 km/h. A Heavy PPC is the Mechs main gun with 5 ER Small Lasers and a Snub Nose PPC as backup weapons. Guardian ECM improves the Mechs survivability.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Improved Lifesupport</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.09</color></b>",
